        "text": "On Saturday, Maria and her classmates visited a community garden near their school. They got there at half past seven. An old farmer, Mr. Zhou, gave each student a small spade. The students watered the vegetables and pulled out weeds between the rows. At ten they had a rest and drank fresh juice. Later, Mr. Zhou showed them how to plant tomato seeds in small pots. Maria said, \"I never knew that seeds need warm soil to grow.\" Before they left, they put a sign on the gate: \"Please don't step on the plants!\"",
